== What this proves ==
# The 1.32.0 provider-only bundle loads, creates a session and renders a
# 1920x1080 frame in Resolve with 'all nodes on CUDA' - given a process that
# can resolve CUDA 13. It does not prove Resolve supplies CUDA 13, and it is
# not the configuration this repository ships.
